    "original_text": "Attributed scoped source restatement:\nFor every real inner-product E, kappa>=1 and phase point z, the exact source Q is bounded by3/2 times the true coordinate energy.\nArbitrary real inner-product E, with no finite-dimension or measurability premise. Kappa>=1 for the comparisons; the total definition accepts every real kappa.\nExisting source Q/API promotion with unchanged proof, no separate mathematical progress credit. Actual deterministic exact-gradient numerical phase contraction at the explicit normalized C2 curvature interface. Actual f=V_eta smoothing/C2/curvature producer remains independently open. No Khat/Kbar substitution, increment/logLambda/B2, invariant law/local errors/history/query work, PBPS, either full main theorem or actual-input expected-cost composition. TV proximity does not transfer unbounded expected cost.",
