    "statement": "theorem phaseQuadraticForm_le_ordinary_energy {kappa : ℝ} (hkappa : 1 ≤ kappa)\n    (z : E × E) :\n    phaseQuadraticForm kappa z ≤ (3 / 2 : ℝ) * (‖z.1‖ ^ 2 + ‖z.2‖ ^ 2)",
    "statement_sha256": "d3d403fbac48f08285c188c892545087cd071c49a6e33b599b843b478729f04c",
